<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8">
        <title>Forecast Initialization: YYYY-MM-DD HHz</title>
    </head>
    <body>
    <h1>NASA GSFC ARCSIX Aerosol and Meteorology Forecasting Support</h1>
    <h2>Forecast Initialization: YYYY-MM-DD HHz</h2>
    <p>These plots are from the GEOS-FP model run produced by
       the NASA Global Modeling and Assimilation Office.
       Details are available 
       <a href="https://gmao.gsfc.nasa.gov/GMAO_products/NRT_products.php">
       here</a>. Most plots are available on the
       <a href="https://fluid.nccs.nasa.gov/missions/mission_ARCSIX/">
       FLUID website</a>.</p>
       <p>This page curated by Peter.R.Colarco at nasa.gov.</p>

       <p><a href="plots">A large collection of plots are available here.</a></p>
       <p><a href="datagrams">Datagrams are available here.</a></p>

    <hr>
    <h2>Prototype Custom Animations (click to enlarge)</h2>
    <table>
     <tr width=100%>
      <h3>Aerosol Optical Depth (AOD)</h3>
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Total AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.TOTEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.TOTEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Sea Salt AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.SSEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.SSEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Organic Carbon AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.OCEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.OCEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Dust AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.DUEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.DUEXTTAU.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
     </tr>
     </table>

     <table>
     <tr width=100%>
      <h3>Aerosol Optical Depth (AOD) with clouds</h3> (white = high cloud,
      grey = low cloud)
     </tr>
     <tr>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Total AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.TOTEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.TOTEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Sea Salt AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.SSEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.SSEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Organic Carbon AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.OCEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.OCEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Dust AOD (550 nm)<br>
      <a href="fp.DUEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HHz.mp4">
      <img src="fp.DUEXTTAU_wcloud.YYYYMMDD_HH+YYYYMMDD_HH00.png" width=260>
      </a>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </table>

    <h3>Cross Sections (click to enlarge)</h3>
    <table>
     <tr>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Alert to North Pole Transect<br>
      <a href="alert.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png">
      <img src="alert.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png" width="260">
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Thule to North Pole Transect<br>
      <a href="greenland.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png">
      <img src="greenland.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png" width="260">
      </a>
      </td>
      <td width=25%>
      <center>Svalbard to North Pole Transect<br>
      <a href="svalbard.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png">
      <img src="svalbard.forecast_OC.YYYYMMDD_HHz.png" width="260">
